tStyle=1;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=6;shadow=0;glass=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1976" y="616" width="599" height="231" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="contract" value="PACKAGING INVARIANTS&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• Every file indexed with path, size and SHA-256; archive can be checked offline.&lt;br/&gt;• Missing required artifact stays visible in a machine-readable gap report.&lt;br/&gt;• The quality result is derived from deterministic policy checks, not an LLM assertion.&lt;br/&gt;• An exhausted or unsuccessful run produces the same package structure, status BLOCKED." style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8faff;strokeColor=#d3ddeb;fontColor=#172842;fontSize=18;fontFamily=Arial;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;strokeWidth=2;fontStyle=0;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=6;shadow=0;glass=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="55" y="967" width="1510" height="271" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="statuses" value="ALLOWED MACHINE STATUSES&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;READY_FOR_OFFLINE_REVIEW&lt;br/&gt;BLOCKED&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Neither means approved, certified, released, or safe to deploy." style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff4df;strokeColor=#d9ba7c;fontColor=#b77b18;fontSize=19;fontFamily=Arial;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;strokeWidth=2;fontStyle=1;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=6;shadow=0;glass=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1645" y="967" width="901" height="271" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="external_line" value="DARK FACTORY BOUNDARY: archive generation and integrity checks complete" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#193253;strokeColor=#193253;fontColor=#ffffff;fontSize=18;fontFamily=Arial;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;strokeWidth=2;fontStyle=1;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=6;shadow=0;glass=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="53" y=